  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "AKS sorting network — Lean formalisation",
  "excerpt": "A formal verification of the Ajtai–Komlós–Szemerédi (1983) `O(n log n)` sorting network construction in [Lean 4](https://lean-lang.org/) with [Mathlib](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), using the Seiferas (2009) separator-based correctness proof and the Margulis–Gabber–Galil (1973/1981) expander. All code and proofs were written by Claude Code + Claude Opus 4.6, with extensive human hand-holding throughout."
 },
